# Lesson 1 "Making Ten" on a phone held upright, by touch (tools/gen-plays.mjs; generated: do not edit): the Learn cards, the lesson's banner
# steps (Got it, select the 4, pair it with the 6), the rest of the board, the results; then Score Chase.
# viewport 390x844@3
until 300 Number Mahjong
frames 30
save title
touch =Learn
until 60 Short interactive lessons
frames 10
save learn
touch =Start
until 300 Welcome to the observatory
until 300 Observe
frames 40
save banner
touch =Got it
until 60 Try the 4
frames 10
touch =tile 4, row 1 column 1, top of stack
until 60 Now tap the 6
frames 10
save lesson-select
touch =tile 6, row 1 column 3, top of stack
until 60 The pair is removed
frames 10
frames 5
touch =tile 7, row 1 column 2, top of stack
frames 5
touch =tile 3, row 1 column 4, top of stack
frames 12
frames 5
touch =tile 8, row 1 column 5, top of stack
frames 5
touch =tile 2, row 1 column 6, top of stack
frames 12
until 300 Board Cleared
frames 30
save results
touch =Leaderboards
until 60 Score Chase
frames 10
save scores
